{"items":[{"owner":{"account_id":22723,"reputation":231858,"user_id":56338,"user_type":"registered","accept_rate":44,"profile_image":"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/92fb4563ddc5ceeaa8b19b60a7a172f4?s=256&d=identicon&r=PG","display_name":"sth","link":"https://stackoverflow.com/users/56338/sth"},"is_accepted":true,"score":27,"last_activity_date":1402398482,"creation_date":1402398482,"answer_id":24139472,"question_id":24139389,"content_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","body":"<p>Return code -11 means \"segmentation fault\". A negative return code usually means that the process was terminated by a signal. Return code -11 means it was signal 11, which is SIGSEGV.</p>\n"}],"has_more":false,"quota_max":300,"quota_remaining":295}